            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You've perfected your ability to keep up with all the skills you've learned over your long life, so you're almost never truly untrained at a skill. You reflect on your life experiences, changing the skill you selected with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Ancestral Longevity] (and the skill you selected with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Expert Longevity] if you have that feat).</p>"
